### Banking Transactions API — sample requests
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (send each request with "Send Request").

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Create a deposit
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit",
  "timestamp": "2024-01-05T09:00:00Z"
}

### Create a transfer
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Create a withdrawal
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 250.75,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### Validation error example (negative amount + invalid currency) -> 400
POST {{base}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": -5,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### List all transactions
GET {{base}}/transactions

### Filter by account
GET {{base}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Filter by type + date range
GET {{base}}/transactions?type=transfer&from=2024-01-01&to=2024-01-31

### Get one transaction (replace with a real id from the list response)
GET {{base}}/transactions/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Account balance
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Account summary (Task 4A)
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

### Simple interest (Task 4B)
GET {{base}}/accounts/ACC-12345/interest?rate=0.05&days=30

### CSV export (Task 4C)
GET {{base}}/transactions/export?format=csv
